_index":"142948","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310123007:0":{"text":"정말 팔라모르 씨의 말대로 밤이 된 뒤에 그곳에 무언가 이변이 생긴 걸까요?","source_cn":"难道真像法拉莫尔先生说的，入夜以后那里出现了异变？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30AAADF1C849247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310123008:0":{"text":"그럼... 마스터, 저흰 이제 어떡하죠?","source_cn":"那……主人，我们该怎么办？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x05412FA0048D4DB9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그럼... 마스터, 저흰 이제 어떡하죠?","female":"그럼... 마스터, 저흰 이제 어떡하죠?","variant_male_record_index":"142954","variant_female_record_index":"142955","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1310123006":{"text":"그렇네요. 초록색 불꽃이에요!","source_cn":"对哦，这是绿色的火！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x519375D585E007AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그렇네요. 초록색 불꽃이에요!","female":"그렇네요. 초록색 불꽃이에요!","variant_male_record_index":"142951","variant_female_record_index":"142952","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310123011:0":{"text":"네, 우선 당황하지 마요. 팔라모르 씨가 곧 돌아올지도 모르잖아요!","source_cn":"嗯，先别慌，说不定法拉莫尔先生很快就会回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98850B844170450D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:1310123012:0":{"text":"시간은 계속 흘러갔지만 팔라모르는 여전히 돌아오지 않았다","source_cn":"时间一分一秒过去，但法拉莫尔却迟迟未归","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57CECDEF77C17102